# Committed build outputs (firmware + host binaries + slot apps).
#
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.uf2 globally; re-include ONLY the firmware
# image below. User content is NOT committed here: the boot animation and the
# ANIMATION keyframe UF2s stay local (tools/builds/ or flash partitions).
!firmware/ydkb_athena75_rgb_advanced_vial.uf2

# Beside it, uf2_common keeps the last ten builds under a timestamp. That is a
# local undo buffer, not something to ship, and the rule is on the directory so
# it holds for whatever else ends up in there.
firmware/history/

# Both packaged sim builds carry the firmware they boot in a Resources/ directory
# -- Contents/Resources inside the .app, beside the .exe in the Windows folder --
# and without this the committed copies have nothing to run.
!sim/**/Resources/firmware.uf2

# Slot apps (src/app/.gitignore ignores *.app under src/app/<name>/).
!apps/
!apps/*.app

# Local-only apps: ACE embeds the keyframe QGF built from private PNGs.
apps/ace.app
apps/hidden/

# athena_sim binaries (tools/build_sim.sh writes sim/<os>/). Committed like
# host_tool: every platform links the static SDL2 the script builds from source,
# so the only remaining dependencies are the ones the OS itself ships.
!sim/
!sim/*/athena_sim
!sim/*/athena_sim.exe
!sim/*/athena_sim_cli
!sim/*/athena_sim_cli.exe
!sim/readme.txt

# Only a build pointed at a shared SDL2 of your own (ATHENA_SDL2_DIR) leaves this
# beside the exe. Third-party binary: keep it local.
sim/*/SDL2.dll
